{"id":"en_betrayed-by-my-alpha-fianc","title":"Betrayed by My Alpha Fiancé","titleEn":"Betrayed by My Alpha Fiancé","description":"Trahie par son fiancé et par celle qui se prétend sa destinée, Ivy Sterling subit une double offense : la voleuse s’empare de sa robe de mariée et la marque au visage. Poussée à bout, elle libère alors l’héritage ancien qui sommeillait en elle, le sang des loups. Sa vengeance demeure toutefois en suspens, laissant planer l’incertitude sur la suite de son affrontement. L’histoire, centrée sur cette trahison et l’éveil d’un pouvoir caché, peut être suivie sur Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/betrayed-by-my-alpha-fiance/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/betrayed-by-my-alpha-fiance/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilaw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_betrayed-by-my-alpha-fianc_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilaw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_betrayed-by-my-alpha-fianc_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilaw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_betrayed-by-my-alpha-fianc_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilaw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_betrayed-by-my-alpha-fianc_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dilaw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_betrayed-by-my